{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は雨が降ったり止んだり\n不安定なお天気でしたね(；-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の日でも元気もりもりなんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晴れの日はもっと元気！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生の時は、毎日お外で遊んでいたから、雨の日でもレジャーシートを引いて傘をいーっぱい両手にもって\n開いた傘をレジャーシートの上に\n重ねて並べて屋根にしたら、\nその傘の中で友達と\nお話したりお菓子を食べたり\nしていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつかしいな～(  ´﹀` )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/04/22/7756233/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とらじゅん\nひなぱんだ\nみおこあら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一昨日は個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬眠から目覚めた3匹の動物たちは\nどうでしたか？(*¯︶¯*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部にコアラになり\n2部にパンダになり\n3部にトラになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれが1番似合ってたかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/04/22/7756233/0001.jpeg"